## Features

- Web-based interface for chest X-ray case review
- Research-oriented workflow for structured evaluation
- Support for comparative study pipelines
- Case presentation and annotation flow for reviewers
- Integration-ready architecture for model outputs and evaluation logic
- Designed for controlled experimentation rather than production clinical use
